1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,490
For the brief, I built one path from a
mixed-format RFQ to a delivered quote.
针对题目，我做了一条从多格式询价到报价交付的完整链路。

2
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:31,565
Five layers: email into S3, Runtime runs agent
dot py, Gateway exposes fourteen tools, the
tools do the work, deliverables back to S3.
五层：邮件进 S3，Runtime 跑
agent.py，Gateway
暴露十四个工具，工具干活，交付物回 S3。

3
00:00:31,565 --> 00:00:48,122
Inside the tools, eight steps from ingest to
render — and the model only reads text.
Everything else is code.
工具里八步，从接入到交付；模型只读文字，其余全是代码。

4
00:00:48,122 --> 00:01:07,197
Question one: I use three. Runtime hosts the
agent, Gateway exposes the fourteen tools with
IAM auth, and Memory keeps state between
calls.
必答题一：我用三样。Runtime 托管
agent，Gateway 带 IAM
鉴权暴露十四个工具，Memory
保存调用之间的状态。

5
00:01:07,197 --> 00:01:27,143
Four I skip: Identity — one caller; Code
Interpreter — prices stay pure; Browser —
nothing to browse; deep tracing — logs are
enough.
另外四项不用：Identity（单调用方）、Code
Interpreter（价格要纯函数）、Browser（没网页）、深度追踪（日志够用）。

6
00:01:27,143 --> 00:01:42,925
Question two: from my LangGraph stack I keep
three things — visible flow, plain-function
tools, and a human sign-off.
必答题二：LangGraph
里我留三样——流程可见、工具是函数、有人点头。

7
00:01:42,925 --> 00:02:03,646
I replace hosting, my own MCP server and the
Mongo checkpointer with Runtime, Gateway and
Memory — and no framework, since the flow is
straight.
托管、自建 MCP、Mongo
checkpointer 换成
Runtime、Gateway、Memory；链路是直的，不用框架。

8
00:02:03,646 --> 00:02:18,557
Let me run the sample RFQ. The front end is a
small local UI, in tools ui py.
演示样例 RFQ。前端是个本地小界面，代码在
tools/ui.py。

9
00:02:18,557 --> 00:02:31,048
I pick the email, tick what to read — body
only first — and generate.
选邮件，勾选要读的内容，先只勾正文，然后生成。

10
00:02:31,048 --> 00:02:45,184
Here are the lines and the suggested price.
Click how for the pricing logic and the
sources.
这是提取出的行和建议价。点 how
看计算逻辑和出处。

11
00:02:45,184 --> 00:02:57,675
Click why for the confidence — the score is
rules, the sentence is the model.
点 why
看置信度——分数由规则算出，解释那句话是模型写的。

12
00:02:57,675 --> 00:03:13,457
Scroll to discount: sliding recomputes margin
and quote. The email's requested discount goes
to Needs sign-off, as a reference.
往下是折扣：拖动即重算毛利率和报价；邮件里的期望折扣放进
Needs sign-off 作参考。

13
00:03:13,457 --> 00:03:30,014
Sliding also regenerates the PDF and the
reply. Above policy, it cannot be approved
directly — it routes to approval.
拖动同时重新生成 PDF
和回信；超过政策线不能直接批，走审批。

14
00:03:30,014 --> 00:03:46,571
Five lines, but not all can be quoted: a held
section explains each, and a conflicts box for
multi-source disagreement.
五行里不是每行都能报价：held
栏逐行解释，Conflicts 栏处理多源冲突。

15
00:03:46,571 --> 00:03:58,190
Generate at this discount produces the review
list, the reply and the quotation PDF.
点这个折扣生成，得到复核清单、回信和报价单
PDF。

16
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:11,456
At the bottom, attachment previews and the
original file; the top navigation has the
other pages.
最下面是附件预览和原件；顶部导航是其它页面。

17
00:04:50,186 --> 00:04:55,995
Now the problems — decided, asked, assumed.
现在讲问题：它决定的、问人的、我假设的。

18
00:04:55,995 --> 00:05:11,778
Decided: quantity from the most authoritative
document, discount from the tier, unpriceable
lines held, policy breaches routed to
approval.
它决定的：数量取最权威文件，折扣按档位，算不出的挂起，越线自动进审批。

19
00:05:11,778 --> 00:05:27,560
Asked: the spacer's quantity, the titanium
price and its tight tolerance, the
drawing-versus-sheet conflict, and the fifteen
percent discount.
问人的：垫片数量、钛合金价格与超紧公差、图纸与表格的冲突、15%
折扣。

20
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:55,737
Assumed — and the table shows it: twenty-five
percent is a margin, not a markup; tiers apply
per line; fifty thousand needs a manager;
eight percent caps the discount; a missing
value is held.
假设都在表里：25%
是毛利率不是加价率；档位按行；五万要经理签字；8%
是折扣上限；缺失值挂起。

21
00:06:47,054 --> 00:07:05,354
Cost: this page reads CloudWatch live. One
quote is about one fen — and the biggest item
is Memory, not the model.
成本：这页实时读
CloudWatch。一份约一分钱，最大项是
Memory，不是模型。

22
00:07:05,354 --> 00:07:22,783
Traces: left is every quote this session;
right, the tool calls — which tool, how long,
what went in and out.
追踪：左边是本次会话每次报价；右边是工具调用——哪个工具、多久、输入输出。

23
00:07:22,783 --> 00:07:39,340
Below, the rule chain per line. Three things I
would improve — each one is a gap, not a bug.
下面是每行规则链。三件要改进的事——每件都是缺口，不是
bug。

24
00:07:39,340 --> 00:08:08,387
One: charts. OCR reads the labels on a
drawing, but not the values plotted inside a
bar or a curve — so a quantity that only
exists in the chart is still invisible to me.
一，图表。OCR
能读图纸上的标签，读不到柱状图或曲线里画出的数值——所以只存在于图里的数量，我现在看不到。

25
00:08:08,387 --> 00:08:36,563
Two: approvals. They land in a queue and
someone can approve them in the page, but
nobody gets an email — that needs SES, and it
is the first thing I would wire next.
二，审批。会进队列、页面上能批准，但没人收到邮件——需要
SES，是我接下来第一个要接的。

26
00:08:36,563 --> 00:08:54,863
Three: the confidence weights — ninety,
seventy, sixty, forty-five — are my judgement,
not learned; they should be fitted to labelled
quotes.
三，可信度权重——90/70/60/45——是我的判断不是学来的；应该用标注过的报价去拟合。

27
00:08:54,863 --> 00:09:09,000
So: rules handle the documents, a person
handles the rest, and I wrote down everything
in between.
一句话：文件里有的规则处理，没有的交给人，中间的全部写成假设。
